---
type: risk_type
id: high_value_replenishment
name: High Value Replenishment
tags: [risk, procurement]
level: high
policy: confirm
applies_to_actions: [create_replenishment_alert]
condition:
  gte:
    - mul:
        - max:
            - 0
            - sub:
                - ref: object.safety_stock
                - ref: object.current_stock
        - ref: object.unit_cost
    - 500
---

## RiskType: High Value Replenishment

Requires human confirmation before a high-value replenishment request is sent.

### Control Policy

- Estimate the order value from shortage quantity and unit cost.
- Require confirmation when the configured value threshold is exceeded.
